a di ritornare a Oxford profondamente cambiata e determinata a creare un mondo in cui una tale guerra non potrà mai più verificarsi."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Testament of Youth is a powerful story of love, war and remembrance, based on the First World War memoir by Vera Brittain, which has become the classic testimony of that war from a woman’s point of view. A searing journey from youthful hopes and dreams to the edge of despair and back again, it’s a film about young love, the futility of war and how to make sense of the darkest times.","tagline":"Divided by war. United by love."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9Qa3PYwiJybq0XI3Y1o8ORZnzbM.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jD0mmfqPRpvJUaPdpLl1vMj38CA.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":284689,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9Qa3PYwiJybq0XI3Y1o8ORZnzbM.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9Qa3PYwiJybq0XI3Y1o8ORZnzbM.jpg","language":"it","width":853,"height":1280},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9Qa3PYwiJybq0XI3Y1o8ORZnzbM.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9Qa3PYwiJybq0XI3Y1o8ORZnzbM.jpg","language":"it","width":853,"height":1280}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a6kFsaDCulCLfYHmKLDKTYaddM4.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/a6kFsaDCulCLfYHmKLDKTYaddM4.jpg","language":"en","width":1366,"height":2048},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a6kFsaDCulCLfYHmKLDKTYaddM4.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/a6kFsaDCulCLfYHmKLDKTYaddM4.jpg","language":"en","width":1366,"height":2048},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original